<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_PropaneCatch_Refining.xml            SEA_FLOOR_AND_CATCH_PASS_1

  Owner ruling 2026-09-24 (question card, "Refinery bill"): the Propane
  Lake's catches are fuel as a MECHANIC, not only as flavour. The shore of
  the Propane Lake becomes a second fuel source beside the pipe-from-the-ship;
  the_propane_lakes.md ban 5 cut the TANKER economy and this is neither a
  tanker nor a pipe (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/sea_catch_rosters_2026-09-24.md,
  question 2).

  Yield is deliberately far above the vanilla organics bill: vanilla
  Make_ChemfuelFromOrganics needs 3.5 nutrition of feedstock (about 25 of
  these catches) for 35 chemfuel, because it is extracting biofuel from food.
  These catches ARE hydrocarbon (Flammability 1.0, crystalline life grown
  from fuel snow), so ten of them render to the same 35 chemfuel at half the
  work. The catches remain valid feedstock for the vanilla bill too; this
  one is simply the right tool.

  Standalone RecipeDef, no ParentName - the same shape as RUT_Vorrel_Recipes
  one mod over. recipeUsers names the vanilla refinery by defName, so a
  refinery from an absent mod is simply not listed rather than failing an
  xpath. MayRequire Odyssey because every ingredient is a FishBase item that
  exists only with Odyssey; without it the recipe would log seven dead
  cross-references.
-->
<Defs>

  <RecipeDef MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey">
    <defName>RUT_Make_ChemfuelFromPropaneCatch</defName>
    <label>render propane catch into chemfuel</label>
    <description>Crack a batch of Propane Lake catch into chemfuel. The creatures of that shore are grown from fuel snow and burn like it; rendering them is closer to decanting than to refining.</description>
    <jobString>Rendering propane catch into chemfuel.</jobString>
    <effectWorking>Cremate</effectWorking>
    <soundWorking>Recipe_Cremate</soundWorking>
    <workAmount>1200</workAmount>
    <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
    <allowMixingIngredients>true</allowMixingIngredients>
    <recipeUsers>
      <li>BiofuelRefinery</li>
    </recipeUsers>
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter>
          <customSummary>propane catch</customSummary>
          <thingDefs>
            <li>RUT_Fessu</li>
            <li>RUT_Krellik</li>
            <li>RUT_Oddu</li>
            <li>RUT_Oovu</li>
            <li>RUT_Iliss</li>
            <li>RUT_Tarnn</li>
            <li>RUT_Zhiil</li>
          </thingDefs>
        </filter>
        <count>10</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <fixedIngredientFilter>
      <thingDefs>
        <li>RUT_Fessu</li>
        <li>RUT_Krellik</li>
        <li>RUT_Oddu</li>
        <li>RUT_Oovu</li>
        <li>RUT_Iliss</li>
        <li>RUT_Tarnn</li>
        <li>RUT_Zhiil</li>
      </thingDefs>
    </fixedIngredientFilter>
    <products>
      <Chemfuel>35</Chemfuel>
    </products>
  </RecipeDef>

</Defs>
